 "verdict": "REJECTED ON BOTH WINDOWS. A: +11.63 -> -11.7/-32.8/-49.6; B: +50.79 -> -4.9/-29.1/-7.1. Win rate collapses ~60% -> 30-43% and maxDD doubles. Mechanism (exit counts): SL exits explode (A: 55 -> 405 at 2xATR) because IMBA enters at channel extremes where noise is maximal \u2014 a tight stop there is systematically eaten, and faster closes double trade count (more fees). CONCLUSION: the wide fib stop is load-bearing, not a flaw; the shipped config (fib stop + tp4=6) is a two-window local optimum. sl_atr_mult stays in code default 0 as a research knob."
